**Bug:** fix-round-3 added a test but the reviewer says it 'hits the mutex check before line 503.' The mutex with --expected-wrapper-sha was added in fix-round-1; passing both is rejected. The happy-path is: `--i-understand-no-gate-2-verification` ALONE (without --expected-wrapper-sha), with prior restore evidence present.

