**Bug:** D-044 row says workflow-side defense will hardcode --tooling-slice-id per workflow file. The 024B-extras workflow has slice-id RESOLUTION (from PR diff) but doesn't HARDCODE it — operator-supplied --allow-not-applicable still in CLI parser. The 'workflow-side defense' is partial.

